      "description": "The target community is individuals who hold Islamophobic, misogynistic, or anti-Muslim political views, particularly those who are hostile toward Muslim women in public office. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences who believe Muslim women are incompatible with Western values, are extremists, or are 'un-American,' and who may also harbor misogynistic beliefs questioning women’s competence in leadership. The visual presentation and labeling of the three Muslim women politicians (Ilhan Omar, Linda Sarsour, Rashida Tlaib) serve as a direct appeal to this community by invoking stereotypes and framing them as targets for criticism or hostility.",
